store-heretic-path-moon = Path of Moon

knowledge-path-moon-s1-name = Moonlight Troupe
knowledge-path-moon-s1-desc =
    Opens up the Path of Moon to you.
    Allows you to transmute a knife and 2 sheets of glass into a Moon Blade.
    You can only create two at a time.

knowledge-path-moon-s2-name = Grasp of Moon
knowledge-path-moon-s2-desc =
    Your mansus grasp clouds identity for 15 seconds and sows confusion.
    Victims lose sanity.

knowledge-path-moon-s3-name = Mark of Moon
knowledge-path-moon-s3-desc =
    Your Mansus Grasp now applies the Mark of Moon.
    Attack a marked person to pacify and confuse them.

knowledge-path-moon-s4-name = Mind Gate
knowledge-path-moon-s4-desc =
    Grants you Mind Gate, a spell which mutes, blinds and confuses over 10 seconds scaled by sanity.
    Casting causes Cellular damage to you and heavy Cellular damage to the target.
    Low sanity targets are knocked down.

knowledge-path-moon-s5-name = Moonlight Amulet
knowledge-path-moon-s5-desc =
    Sculpt a Moonlight Amulet from a heart, glass and cloth.
    Channel it to convert low sanity heathens, sleep mindshielded ones, damage others.
    Wearing it grants thermal vision and boosts your passive.

knowledge-path-moon-s6-name = Lunar Parade
knowledge-path-moon-s6-desc =
    Grants you Lunar Parade, a slow projectile that leashes those hit and drains sanity.

knowledge-path-moon-s7-name = Moonlight Blade
knowledge-path-moon-s7-desc =
    Your blade now drains sanity and deals Cellular damage, more to low sanity or sleeping victims.

knowledge-path-moon-s8-name = Ringleaders Rise
knowledge-path-moon-s8-desc =
    Summon an echo per nearby victim. Attacked echoes burst with stun and Cellular damage.

knowledge-path-moon-s9-name = The Last Act
knowledge-path-moon-s9-desc =
    The ascension ritual of the Path of Moon.
    Bring 3 corpses to a transmutation rune.
    Mass-convert a fifth of the crew to lunatics and gain a madness aura.
